# Admin platform (confirmed)

Two dashboards: **Nivra admin** (`/admin`) and **Company admin** (`/company`).

**Auth:** Clerk (identity + sessions only). **Orgs / entitlements:** Neon + Prisma. See [`docs/DATA_MODEL.md`](../../docs/DATA_MODEL.md).

## Product rules

- **Tenancy:** shared app `nivra.app`; company branding after login. No custom subdomain/domain at launch. One org per user. Advisors only — no client logins.
- **Roles:** `NIVRA_ADMIN` · `COMPANY_ADMIN` · `COMPANY_EMPLOYEE` (UI may still label employees as advisor/viewer).
- **Sessions:** one Clerk session per user; new login revokes older sessions.
- **Member seats:** not capped in v1.
- **Lock:** soft-lock expired/suspended for **3 days** (view-only), then hard lock.
- **Branding:** Nivra logo on app chrome; company branding on PDF reports. **"Powered by Nivra"** on every footer + report.
- **Invariant:** calculator engine never stores client PII / inputs / results / PDFs.

## Tech stack

| Concern | Choice | Notes |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Hosting | Vercel | Free → Pro ~$20/mo |
| DB | Neon + Prisma | Free 0.5 GB → usage paid |
| Email | Brevo | Free ~300/day |
| Images | ImageKit | Logos |
| Auth | Clerk | Orgs in Neon, not Clerk Organizations |
| Logs | Better Stack | Free 3 GB / 3 days |

Keep admin UI on shadcn shell tokens; reuse calculator kit only for calc pages. Razorpay remains stubbed until gateway credentials land.
